{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 13894733228212164814,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "x86 CPU Features and Alternatives",
      "source_hash": 11842292669883743815,
      "context_hash": 12610424811795336463,
      "translation": "x86 CPU 기능과 Alternatives",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332766Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "CPUID, feature flags, alternative patching, and hardware capabilities",
      "source_hash": 7837474194751913083,
      "context_hash": 5248077591687675615,
      "translation": "CPUID, 기능 플래그, alternative 패칭, 하드웨어 기능",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332767Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel must run on CPUs spanning decades of x86 evolution — from early Pentium 4s to the latest AMD Zen or Intel Core generations.",
      "source_hash": 13168735979929109226,
      "context_hash": 7579474316761099254,
      "translation": "커널은 수십 년에 걸친 x86 발전 과정의 CPU, 즉 초기 Pentium 4부터 최신 AMD Zen이나 Intel Core 세대까지에서 모두 동작해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "AMD": "AMD",
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "Intel": "Intel"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332767Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "The CPU feature detection and alternative patching infrastructure allows the kernel to be compiled once and then automatically tune itself to the current hardware at boot time.",
      "source_hash": 15049685181166169252,
      "context_hash": 10005466459669419377,
      "translation": "CPU 기능 감지 및 alternative 패칭(alternative patching) 인프라 덕분에 커널은 한 번만 컴파일된 뒤 부팅 시점에 현재 하드웨어에 맞게 스스로를 자동으로 조정할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "hardware": "하드웨어",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332767Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "CPUID: querying CPU capabilities",
      "source_hash": 15619712573887435364,
      "context_hash": 12898066852353831200,
      "translation": "CPUID: CPU 기능 조회",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332767Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`CPUID` is the x86 instruction for enumerating CPU capabilities.",
      "source_hash": 11527840844550824171,
      "context_hash": 9505079685298286344,
      "translation": "`CPUID`는 CPU 기능을 열거하는 x86 명령어입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332767Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The caller loads a **leaf number** into `EAX` (and sometimes a subleaf into `ECX`) before executing `CPUID`.",
      "source_hash": 9602408200730073431,
      "context_hash": 13239927492583706742,
      "translation": "호출자는 `CPUID`를 실행하기 전에 `EAX`에 **leaf 번호**를 (경우에 따라 `ECX`에 subleaf를) 로드합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332767Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "The CPU returns capability bits in `EAX`, `EBX`, `ECX`, and `EDX`.",
      "source_hash": 13691451648996968187,
      "context_hash": 2975981361789132592,
      "translation": "CPU는 `EAX`, `EBX`, `ECX`, `EDX`에 기능 비트를 반환합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "bits": "비트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332767Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel calls CPUID during early boot in `arch/x86/kernel/cpu/common.c` via `cpuid()` and `cpuid_count()` helpers:",
      "source_hash": 7856565859568967644,
      "context_hash": 13128921834944841750,
      "translation": "커널은 초기 부팅 중 `arch/x86/kernel/cpu/common.c`에서 `cpuid()` 및 `cpuid_count()` 헬퍼를 통해 CPUID를 호출합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332767Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "x86_capability[]: the kernel's feature bitmask",
      "source_hash": 2330115053045738672,
      "context_hash": 3770014766958803855,
      "translation": "x86_capability[]: 커널의 기능 비트마스크",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332768Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "After parsing all CPUID leaves, the kernel stores CPU features in the `x86_capability` array inside `struct cpuinfo_x86`:",
      "source_hash": 1055801771994756088,
      "context_hash": 6866436011261576234,
      "translation": "모든 CPUID leaf를 파싱한 뒤, 커널은 CPU 기능을 `struct cpuinfo_x86` 안의 `x86_capability` 배열에 저장합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "array": "배열",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332768Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`NCAPINTS` is the number of 32-bit words in the feature bitmask array.",
      "source_hash": 7883749932228947792,
      "context_hash": 6908587503418228706,
      "translation": "`NCAPINTS`는 기능 비트마스크 배열에 있는 32비트 워드의 개수입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "array": "배열",
        "bit": "비트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332768Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Each bit corresponds to one `X86_FEATURE_*` constant.",
      "source_hash": 4803653080813937145,
      "context_hash": 17645819432837123632,
      "translation": "각 비트는 하나의 `X86_FEATURE_*` 상수에 대응합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bit": "비트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332768Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "The words map to CPUID output registers in a defined order:",
      "source_hash": 15377975090676226352,
      "context_hash": 14796233492302239107,
      "translation": "각 워드는 정해진 순서에 따라 CPUID 출력 레지스터에 대응합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332768Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Three ways to check CPU features",
      "source_hash": 6973288015264558796,
      "context_hash": 734786710443307408,
      "translation": "CPU 기능을 확인하는 세 가지 방법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332768Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel provides three macros for checking features, with different performance characteristics:",
      "source_hash": 3075735410342838378,
      "context_hash": 4204810161217791991,
      "translation": "커널은 기능 확인을 위해 성능 특성이 서로 다른 세 가지 매크로를 제공합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "macro": "매크로"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332768Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "1. cpu_has(): runtime check",
      "source_hash": 3211646729468422884,
      "context_hash": 3145293938904085327,
      "translation": "1\\. cpu_has(): 런타임 검사",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332768Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "`cpu_has()` is a runtime check — it reads from the `x86_capability` array.",
      "source_hash": 13214701179197141151,
      "context_hash": 11798492681415672775,
      "translation": "`cpu_has()`는 런타임 검사로, `x86_capability` 배열에서 값을 읽습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "array": "배열"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332768Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Use this when you need to check a specific CPU (not just the boot CPU), or in early boot before alternatives are patched.",
      "source_hash": 4146115649020565204,
      "context_hash": 5134862780699161291,
      "translation": "부팅 CPU뿐만 아니라 특정 CPU를 검사해야 할 때나, alternative가 패칭되기 전인 초기 부팅 단계에서 이를 사용하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332768Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "2. boot_cpu_has(): boot-time check",
      "source_hash": 11384948553498297791,
      "context_hash": 9200378484053145629,
      "translation": "2\\. boot_cpu_has(): 부팅 시점 검사",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332768Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "`boot_cpu_has()` checks the boot CPU's feature flags.",
      "source_hash": 3345430848111224131,
      "context_hash": 2239607454082271215,
      "translation": "`boot_cpu_has()`는 부팅 CPU의 기능 플래그를 검사합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332768Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:7/seg:1",
      "source": "Used for one-time setup decisions during boot.",
      "source_hash": 16561212085252919239,
      "context_hash": 10815590435827820941,
      "translation": "부팅 중 일회성 설정 결정에 사용됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332768Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:7/seg:2",
      "source": "These calls are not patched by the alternatives mechanism.",
      "source_hash": 17212682795200551723,
      "context_hash": 3319548608606219812,
      "translation": "이 호출들은 alternatives 메커니즘에 의해 패칭되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332768Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "3. static_cpu_has(): compile-time patched",
      "source_hash": 9367858072730756629,
      "context_hash": 8246193978166449173,
      "translation": "3\\. static_cpu_has(): 컴파일 시점 패칭",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332768Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "`static_cpu_has()` emits a **patchable** instruction sequence.",
      "source_hash": 2744730027222299577,
      "context_hash": 174981662882150754,
      "translation": "`static_cpu_has()`는 **패칭 가능한** 명령어 시퀀스를 생성합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332768Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:10/seg:1",
      "source": "At boot, `apply_alternatives()` patches the code in place:",
      "source_hash": 8884873094507873137,
      "context_hash": 167421966078403933,
      "translation": "부팅 시 `apply_alternatives()`가 코드를 제자리에서 패칭합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332769Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "If the feature is **present**: the test is replaced with `jmp over_else` (always take the if-branch)",
      "source_hash": 7863259734160401110,
      "context_hash": 12273488878172965747,
      "translation": "기능이 **있는** 경우: 검사가 `jmp over_else`로 대체됩니다(항상 if 분기를 실행)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332769Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "If the feature is **absent**: the test is replaced with `jmp over_if` (always take the else-branch)",
      "source_hash": 17039012057493271708,
      "context_hash": 11612984195717857826,
      "translation": "기능이 **없는** 경우: 검사가 `jmp over_if`로 대체됩니다(항상 else 분기를 실행)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332769Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "After patching, the check becomes a single unconditional branch — zero overhead compared to a memory read.",
      "source_hash": 12841339927383263498,
      "context_hash": 10289554542654926293,
      "translation": "패칭 후 검사는 단일 무조건 분기가 되므로, 메모리 읽기에 비해 오버헤드가 전혀 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "memory": "메모리",
        "overhead": "오버헤드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332769Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Alternative patching",
      "source_hash": 1208032634865921356,
      "context_hash": 2930628632842963517,
      "translation": "Alternative 패칭",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332769Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The **alternative** mechanism allows the kernel to ship with safe, conservative code and then patch in optimized instruction sequences at boot time based on the actual CPU capabilities.",
      "source_hash": 4581810316156379888,
      "context_hash": 10753941273530782617,
      "translation": "**alternative** 메커니즘을 사용하면 커널은 안전하고 보수적인 코드로 배포된 뒤, 부팅 시점에 실제 CPU 기능에 따라 최적화된 명령어 시퀀스를 패칭해 넣을 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332769Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The ALTERNATIVE macro",
      "source_hash": 530969075744738591,
      "context_hash": 9121947676977219532,
      "translation": "ALTERNATIVE 매크로",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "macro": "매크로"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:59:59.332769Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The default instruction (`orig_insn`) is emitted inline in the `.text` section.",
      "source_hash": 6767993128662968641,
      "context_hash": 7118163247387279856,
      "translation": "기본 명령어(`orig_insn`)는 `.text` 섹션에 인라인으로 생성됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081688Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "The replacement instruction (`alt_insn`) is placed in `.altinstr_replacement`.",
      "source_hash": 8597189948346773875,
      "context_hash": 17878581539247291597,
      "translation": "대체 명령어(`alt_insn`)는 `.altinstr_replacement`에 배치됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081688Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:2",
      "source": "A descriptor (`struct alt_instr`) is placed in `.altinstructions` to describe the patching.",
      "source_hash": 2326875101543373484,
      "context_hash": 3773855055816928793,
      "translation": "패칭 방법을 기술하는 디스크립터(`struct alt_instr`)는 `.altinstructions`에 배치됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "descriptor": "디스크립터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081689Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "struct alt_instr",
      "source_hash": 2056162992481939957,
      "context_hash": 3752792664742577911,
      "translation": "struct alt_instr",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081689Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "apply_alternatives() at boot",
      "source_hash": 3182395883958206538,
      "context_hash": 7431808698862443699,
      "translation": "부팅 시의 apply_alternatives()",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081689Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "`apply_alternatives()` is called during `start_kernel()` via `alternative_instructions()`.",
      "source_hash": 8383831944623216343,
      "context_hash": 7977264705349188243,
      "translation": "`apply_alternatives()`는 `start_kernel()` 실행 중에 `alternative_instructions()`를 통해 호출됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081689Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:9/seg:1",
      "source": "It iterates the `.altinstructions` section and patches each instruction in place using `text_poke_early()` (which temporarily makes `.text` writable).",
      "source_hash": 7528667622986390161,
      "context_hash": 583558643221586065,
      "translation": "이 함수는 `.altinstructions` 섹션을 순회하면서 `text_poke_early()`(`.text`를 일시적으로 쓰기 가능하게 만듭니다)를 사용해 각 명령어를 제자리에서 패치합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081689Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Real examples of alternative use",
      "source_hash": 5596871504479113555,
      "context_hash": 12030950829177699693,
      "translation": "alternative 사용의 실제 예",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081689Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "CPU bug flags: x86_bugs[]",
      "source_hash": 2888865070776322425,
      "context_hash": 17680797718175360405,
      "translation": "CPU 버그 플래그: x86_bugs[]",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "bug": "버그"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081689Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "In addition to feature flags, the kernel maintains a set of **bug flags** in the upper `NBUGINTS` words of `x86_capability[]`.",
      "source_hash": 2155629861181847908,
      "context_hash": 8802589314866600209,
      "translation": "커널은 기능 플래그 외에도 `x86_capability[]`의 상위 `NBUGINTS` 워드에 **버그 플래그** 집합을 유지합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bug": "버그",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081689Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "These are set during early CPU detection to indicate that a CPU requires a mitigation:",
      "source_hash": 16682042221996078378,
      "context_hash": 7228466096929393637,
      "translation": "이 플래그들은 CPU에 완화 조치(mitigation)가 필요함을 나타내기 위해 초기 CPU 감지 과정에서 설정됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081689Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Bug flags are set in `arch/x86/kernel/cpu/bugs.c` during `check_bugs()`:",
      "source_hash": 17531057761182630964,
      "context_hash": 6359176917935879384,
      "translation": "버그 플래그는 `check_bugs()` 실행 중에 `arch/x86/kernel/cpu/bugs.c`에서 설정됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bug": "버그"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081689Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Key CPU features in the kernel",
      "source_hash": 3175138492128021839,
      "context_hash": 5192424817673710597,
      "translation": "커널의 주요 CPU 기능",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081689Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "X86_FEATURE_FSGSBASE",
      "source_hash": 5256958447279410216,
      "context_hash": 9946304333533658254,
      "translation": "X86_FEATURE_FSGSBASE",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081689Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Adds `RDFSBASE`, `WRFSBASE`, `RDGSBASE`, `WRGSBASE` instructions — fast reads and writes of the FS and GS segment base registers without going through the MSR interface.",
      "source_hash": 8857513850628853854,
      "context_hash": 17915332570933834195,
      "translation": "`RDFSBASE`, `WRFSBASE`, `RDGSBASE`, `WRGSBASE` 명령어를 추가합니다. 이 명령어들은 MSR 인터페이스를 거치지 않고 FS 및 GS 세그먼트 베이스 레지스터를 빠르게 읽고 씁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "MSR": "MSR"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081689Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Without FSGSBASE: setting FS.base requires `wrmsr(MSR_FS_BASE, value)` — a serializing instruction",
      "source_hash": 17625286730229334431,
      "context_hash": 2797288899403785397,
      "translation": "FSGSBASE가 없는 경우: FS.base를 설정하려면 직렬화 명령어인 `wrmsr(MSR_FS_BASE, value)`가 필요합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081689Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "With FSGSBASE: `wrfsbase(value)` — much faster; used for TLS in userspace and glibc's implementation of thread-local storage",
      "source_hash": 3089505492088858321,
      "context_hash": 3601640618167468562,
      "translation": "FSGSBASE가 있는 경우: `wrfsbase(value)`를 사용하며 훨씬 빠릅니다. 사용자 공간의 TLS와 glibc의 스레드 로컬 스토리지(thread-local storage) 구현에 사용됩니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "glibc": "glibc",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081690Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel enables FSGSBASE (sets `CR4.FSGSBASE`) if the CPU supports it.",
      "source_hash": 14083197593584527844,
      "context_hash": 6013858667028088534,
      "translation": "CPU가 지원하면 커널은 FSGSBASE를 활성화합니다(`CR4.FSGSBASE`를 설정합니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081690Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "Support was added in **Linux 5.9**.",
      "source_hash": 16472989059585168975,
      "context_hash": 8204201040242912195,
      "translation": "이 지원은 **Linux 5.9**에서 추가되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081690Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "X86_FEATURE_INVPCID",
      "source_hash": 13387245679463246474,
      "context_hash": 2124086686926155217,
      "translation": "X86_FEATURE_INVPCID",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081690Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "`INVPCID` (Invalidate Process-Context Identifier) instruction: selectively invalidate TLB entries by PCID and virtual address, or flush all non-global entries for a specific PCID.",
      "source_hash": 15991135661701011973,
      "context_hash": 4747995288184612605,
      "translation": "`INVPCID`(Invalidate Process-Context Identifier) 명령어: PCID와 가상 주소를 기준으로 TLB 엔트리를 선택적으로 무효화하거나, 특정 PCID의 global이 아닌 엔트리를 모두 플러시합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "PCID": "PCID",
        "TLB entry": "TLB 엔트리",
        "virtual address": "가상 주소"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081690Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Without INVPCID, PCID flushing requires writing CR3 (which flushes all TLB entries for that PCID).",
      "source_hash": 5562901457136495815,
      "context_hash": 1014163236439313246,
      "translation": "INVPCID가 없으면 PCID 플러시를 위해 CR3에 값을 써야 합니다(이 경우 해당 PCID의 TLB 엔트리가 모두 플러시됩니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "PCID": "PCID",
        "TLB entry": "TLB 엔트리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081690Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:8/seg:1",
      "source": "INVPCID is more precise and faster.",
      "source_hash": 11952679491789148699,
      "context_hash": 3916830834132171589,
      "translation": "INVPCID가 더 정밀하고 빠릅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081690Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Some early Haswell CPUs support PCID but not INVPCID — the kernel detects this and falls back to CR3-based flushing.",
      "source_hash": 12687255966791360946,
      "context_hash": 10327837401481617062,
      "translation": "일부 초기 Haswell CPU는 PCID는 지원하지만 INVPCID는 지원하지 않습니다. 커널은 이를 감지하여 CR3 기반 플러시로 대체합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "PCID": "PCID"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081690Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "X86_FEATURE_PKU",
      "source_hash": 17192195871009901009,
      "context_hash": 15021119761536089783,
      "translation": "X86_FEATURE_PKU",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081691Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "**Protection Keys for Userspace (PKU)**: allows user-space code to mark memory regions with a 4-bit \"protection key.\" The `PKRU` register controls access rights (read/write disable) for each of the 16 possible keys, without requiring a syscall or page table modification.",
      "source_hash": 3350357052361146018,
      "context_hash": 6370711938618127312,
      "translation": "**Protection Keys for Userspace (PKU)**: 사용자 공간 코드가 메모리 영역에 4비트 \"보호 키(protection key)\"를 표시할 수 있게 합니다. `PKRU` 레지스터는 시스템 콜이나 페이지 테이블 수정 없이 16개의 가능한 키 각각에 대한 접근 권한(읽기/쓰기 비활성화)을 제어합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bit": "비트",
        "memory": "메모리",
        "page table": "페이지 테이블",
        "syscall": "시스템 콜",
        "user-space": "사용자 공간",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081691Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "Useful for isolating sensitive data within a process (e.g., OpenSSL's private keys).",
      "source_hash": 4240959226361215058,
      "context_hash": 9108659969102721003,
      "translation": "프로세스 내부의 민감한 데이터(예: OpenSSL의 개인 키)를 격리하는 데 유용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "process": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081691Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:12/seg:1",
      "source": "Kernel support added in **Linux 4.6**.",
      "source_hash": 7125643598777794777,
      "context_hash": 15894165642438327901,
      "translation": "커널 지원은 **Linux 4.6**에서 추가되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081692Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "X86_FEATURE_UMIP",
      "source_hash": 10536152926529835189,
      "context_hash": 205845814679879516,
      "translation": "X86_FEATURE_UMIP",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081692Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "**User-Mode Instruction Prevention**: when `CR4.UMIP = 1`, executing `SGDT`, `SIDT`, `SLDT`, `SMSW`, or `STR` in ring 3 generates a #GP instead of returning hardware descriptor table addresses.",
      "source_hash": 18334986750449216564,
      "context_hash": 12729163987956284127,
      "translation": "**User-Mode Instruction Prevention**: `CR4.UMIP = 1`이면 ring 3에서 `SGDT`, `SIDT`, `SLDT`, `SMSW`, `STR`을 실행할 때 하드웨어 디스크립터 테이블 주소를 반환하는 대신 #GP가 발생합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "addresses": "주소",
        "descriptor": "디스크립터",
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081692Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "Prevents user processes from learning the addresses of IDT, GDT, and LDT — useful for defeating ASLR bypasses.",
      "source_hash": 16001810458840016194,
      "context_hash": 6406663111175559551,
      "translation": "사용자 프로세스가 IDT, GDT, LDT의 주소를 알아내지 못하게 하므로 ASLR 우회를 막는 데 유용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "addresses": "주소",
        "processes": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081692Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:15/seg:1",
      "source": "Linux enables UMIP automatically when available.",
      "source_hash": 12954245003245625993,
      "context_hash": 14127453302310422495,
      "translation": "Linux는 UMIP를 사용할 수 있으면 자동으로 활성화합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:00:04.081692Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "X86_FEATURE_RDRAND",
      "source_hash": 13123319440287797315,
      "context_hash": 16290106111345638267,
      "translation": "X86_FEATURE_RDRAND",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:01:06.100774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "`RDRAND` instruction: hardware random number generator that returns cryptographically random values.",
      "source_hash": 2112701239180879406,
      "context_hash": 4808681503841843393,
      "translation": "`RDRAND` 명령어: 암호학적으로 안전한 난수 값을 반환하는 하드웨어 난수 생성기입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:01:06.100774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:17/seg:1",
      "source": "The kernel uses it as an entropy source for `/dev/random` and friends.",
      "source_hash": 3185059145106545495,
      "context_hash": 15650003271928170018,
      "translation": "커널은 이를 `/dev/random` 등의 엔트로피 소스로 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:01:06.100774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:17/seg:2",
      "source": "Note: `RDRAND` alone is not trusted as the sole entropy source in the kernel (a bug in Intel's implementation of `RDRAND` was discovered on some Ivy Bridge systems returning constant values).",
      "source_hash": 9792016757204830885,
      "context_hash": 5173790488827294895,
      "translation": "참고: 커널은 `RDRAND`만을 유일한 엔트로피 소스로 신뢰하지 않습니다(일부 Ivy Bridge 시스템에서 Intel의 `RDRAND` 구현에 상수 값을 반환하는 버그가 발견되었습니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Intel": "Intel",
        "bug": "버그",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:01:06.100774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
